{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_04",
  "title": "7:59P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "27d4819483ed2997e5e6a4e6749795cd656ed2d11f08f5e1c36269d371f06399",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）\n7:59 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n龍門人工河流，碼頭"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下次不要再突然跳到船上了啊！很危險的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "對不起，事出有因才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "請問剛才你有看見一位薩科塔人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒看見啦，真是受不了，這些糖果可是今晚的後夜派對要用的，要是耽誤了你賠得起......唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩、薩科塔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "啊！莫斯提馬小——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "莫斯提馬？你認識莫斯提馬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......不好意思，是我認錯人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（這個人，好像在哪裡見過？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳嗯，總之這次就先放過你了，下次不要再做這麼危險的事情了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，真的是麻煩你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯......年輕的豐蹄......總覺得好像忘了什麼......是什麼呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "哇！？你要做什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你的角上卡著一顆糖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "啊，真的。是不是該還回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "還有，看到這對角，我想起來了！和那個峯馳的標誌一模一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你是峯馳物流的小少爺，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "小、小少爺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "空前輩，這條路真的能和德克薩斯小姐他們會合嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "放心放心，德克薩斯在想什麼，我可是一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......這個聲音總有種熟悉感，在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "“前輩”嗎，嘿嘿，想不到我也會有帶著信使後輩的一天~你對大家的印象如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "印象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "非常，呃，激動人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊哈哈......我大概能猜到什麼情況了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊，抱歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走路注意點啊！嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "明明是你衝過來的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？關你屁事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "你這小鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "算啦算啦，隨他去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "可是他剛才偷走了你的錢包——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我知道哦，不過那個錢包裡只裝了南瓜糖就是了。你看，真正的錢包在這兒~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "“不給糖就搗蛋”嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "可他是直接來搗蛋的，而且今天也不是......為什麼要特地這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "龍門最近經歷了很多事情，雖然在今天不太看得出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "安魂夜的蠟燭照亮不到這座城市的所有角落，這些孩子也太可憐了點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "誒嘿，不過說到底還是一時興起啦，不錯的主意吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "那如果被偷的是我可怎麼辦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "前面出去，就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "這裡是......剛才的公園？又回到這裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "看吧，果然在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——唔唔唔，唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "喂，你再不說，我可就要點火了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "小哥你還是老實招了吧，這個煙火真的能帶著你上天的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......你們忘了把他嘴上的膠布撕掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉，嘿咻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們這群傢伙！你們真的知道我們是什麼人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......敘拉古，黑手黨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，德、德克薩斯嗎......別以為我們會怕你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "知道你們不怕啦，畢竟你們把老闆的珍藏品全部炸飛了。糖果盒炸彈嗎，真是孩子氣的陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可不知道什麼糖果盒，笑話！如果真是首領親自出手，你們早就被炸成碎片——唔唔！唔唔唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可是這傢伙也太臭屁了，不如直接把他炸了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "有點耐心，能天使，讓他說下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗哈——哼，你們就不奇怪為什麼龍門根本對我們睜一隻眼閉一隻眼嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不，一般來說除了每個月要去警署報個到把公共財產妨害的罰款結一下，平時也不怎麼管我們哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "唉，能天使姐你別打斷人家啊，你繼續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看你們這樣子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那一位已經默許了我們對企鵝物流的所有行動，既然都是龍門的灰色勢力，你們肯定明白這意味著什麼吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我們可是有合法營運執照的物流公司哦？而且營運狀況其實還不錯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "所以為什麼每次我們都要被當做......唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "那一位，是哪一位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這種裝腔作勢的說法真的太蠢了，透露著一股雜魚的氣息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還裝傻！？鼠王可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "喂！德克薩斯！大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊，是阿空！喂~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯？拜松好像也在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嘿嘿，路上遇到落單的拜松，就把他帶來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......你們這是在幹什麼？大帝先生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "老闆說是有想要確認的事情，就去了別的地方啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "空，沒有遇見其他人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "欸？沒......有吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯？看著我幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "沒、沒什麼。總之，事情的來龍去脈我都已經聽拜松說了，接下來我們該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "先從這傢伙嘴裡問出點什麼，然後對·症·下·藥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "等一下，能天使小姐，那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "其實，剛才我遇到了莫斯提馬小姐。但是，她不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "呃，我的意思是，我們逃避黑手黨的包圍，然後她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......不用擔心她，常有的事啦，畢竟她一不留神就能消失好幾年嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "——好幾年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "話說，我進了公司之後幾乎都沒見過她的面喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊哈哈，就不要刺激能天使了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "這還真是非常的......脫離常識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "身為信使，她很特殊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "雖然和老闆有著契約關係，但更多的還是她身為拉特蘭的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——能天使，別恍神，注意你的火柴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊，不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔唔唔——唔唔——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "誒呀，已經來不及了。算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔唔唔——！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事，剛才聽見了弗倫佐的慘叫聲！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那邊那個方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "真的能帶著活人飛上天啊，那這煙火還挺厲害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "先應付敵人，左右分工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
